From 1c603e2b594effab99dc4434ba10597b498f2519 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 22:12:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Implement live /availability: walk warm portal session to the
 transport row's time grid

- sessionDriver: collectAvailability() reuses the pre-warmed session (or starts one), advances
  entry -> vehicle -> mileage -> service (exact label or TELL US) -> advisor/date -> time grid with
  screen-change assertions on the two known click races, then lists visible enabled times scoped
  to the requested transport row (same ancestor walk as clickTimeInTransportRow). After-hours
  returns the single 'Before 06:00am' pseudo-slot. Read-only; never reaches review or ADD APPOINTMENT.
- escapeRegex() so the four asterisk-prefixed service labels no longer throw inside evaluate.
- server: /availability is async, accepts session_id/call_id, returns success only when at least
  one slot was positively extracted; every other outcome is success:false with a trace for debugging.
  LIVE_AVAILABILITY_ENABLED=false kill switch. /health reports the flag.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
